            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nThis will not be available by default, as 'mini.statusline' is mostly designed to have colors in left (mode) and right (location) section. You can them by creating own highlight groups and using them inside `signs` of `section_diagnostics()`, as shown in #1278.\n\nClosing as duplicate.",
